@host = http://localhost:5081

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Obter token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "comerciante",
  "senha": "Fluxo@2026"
}

### Registrar crédito
POST {{host}}/api/v1/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": 1,
  "valor": 150.50,
  "data": "2026-08-17",
  "descricao": "Venda no balcão"
}

### Registrar débito
POST {{host}}/api/v1/lancamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": 2,
  "valor": 40.00,
  "data": "2026-08-17",
  "descricao": "Pagamento de fornecedor"
}

### Listar lançamentos do dia (paginado)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/lancamentos?data=2026-08-17&pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
